@host = http://localhost:5119

### 1. Get all geography
GET {{host}}/api/geography
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get geography by ID
GET {{host}}/api/geography/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create geography
POST {{host}}/api/geography
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "country",
  "value": "Italy"
}

###

### 4. Delete geography
DELETE {{host}}/api/geography/9

###